#: languages/cpp/debugger/debuggerpart.cpp:128
msgid ""
"<b>Frame stack</b>"
"<p>Often referred to as the \"call stack\", this is a list showing what "
"function is currently active and who called each function to get to this point "
"in your program. By clicking on an item you can see the values in any of the "
"previous calling functions."
msgstr ""
"<b>फ्रेम थाक</b>"
"<p>प्राय \"कल थाक\" भनिने, यो सूचीले हाल सक्रिय प्रकार्य र तपाईँको कार्यक्रममा "
"यो बिन्दु प्राप्त गर्न कसले प्रत्येक प्रकार्य कल गर्यो भनि देखाउछ । एउटा "
"वस्तुमा क्लिक गरेर तपाईँले अघिल्लो कलिङ प्रकार्यको कुनैमा मानहरू हेर्न "
"सक्नुहुन्छ ।"

#: languages/cpp/debugger/debuggerpart.cpp:137
