#: languages/cpp/debugger/debuggerpart.cpp:240
msgid ""
"<b>Step over</b>"
"<p>Executes one line of source in the current source file. If the source line "
"is a call to a function the whole function is executed and the app will stop at "
"the line following the function call."
msgstr ""
"<b>अगाडिको चरण</b>"
"<p>हालको स्रोत फाइलमा स्रोतको एउटा लाइन कार्यान्वयन गर्दछ । यदि स्रोत लाइन "
"प्रकार्यमा कल हो भने पूरा प्रकार्य कार्यान्वयन गरिन्छ  र app ले प्रकार्य कलको "
"बेलामा लाइन रोक्दछ ।"

#: languages/cpp/debugger/debuggerpart.cpp:247
msgid "Step over Ins&truction"
msgstr "अगाडिको चरण निर्देशन"

#: languages/cpp/debugger/debuggerpart.cpp:250
msgid "Step over instruction"
msgstr "अगाडिको चरण निर्देशन"

#: languages/cpp/debugger/debuggerpart.cpp:251
msgid ""
"<b>Step over instruction</b>"
"<p>Steps over the next assembly instruction."
msgstr "<b>अगाडिको चरण निर्देशन</b><p>पछिल्लो संयोजन निर्देशनमा अगाडि जान्छ ।"

#: languages/cpp/debugger/debuggerpart.cpp:254
#: languages/ruby/debugger/debuggerpart.cpp:203
msgid "Step &Into"
msgstr "यस भित्रको चरण"

#: languages/cpp/debugger/debuggerpart.cpp:257
#: languages/ruby/debugger/debuggerpart.cpp:206
msgid "Step into the next statement"
msgstr "पछिल्लो कथनमा जानुहोस्"

#: languages/cpp/debugger/debuggerpart.cpp:258
msgid ""
"<b>Step into</b>"
"<p>Executes exactly one line of source. If the source line is a call to a "
"function then execution will stop after the function has been entered."
msgstr ""
"<b>यस भित्रको चरण</b>"
"<p>स्रोतको एउटा लाइन कार्यान्वयन गर्दछ । यदि स्रोत लाइन कल हो भने प्रकार्य "
"प्रविष्ट गरेपछि कार्यान्वयन रोकिन्छ ।"

#: languages/cpp/debugger/debuggerpart.cpp:264
msgid "Step into I&nstruction"
msgstr "निर्देशनमा जानुहोस्"

#: languages/cpp/debugger/debuggerpart.cpp:267
msgid "Step into instruction"
msgstr "निर्देशनमा जानुहोस्"

#: languages/cpp/debugger/debuggerpart.cpp:268
msgid ""
"<b>Step into instruction</b>"
"<p>Steps into the next assembly instruction."
msgstr "<b>निर्देशनमा जानुहोस्</b><p>पछिल्लो संयोजन निर्देशनमा जान्छ ।"

#: languages/cpp/debugger/debuggerpart.cpp:271
#: languages/ruby/debugger/debuggerpart.cpp:214
msgid "Step O&ut"
msgstr "निस्कनुहोस्"

#: languages/cpp/debugger/debuggerpart.cpp:274
msgid "Steps out of the current function"
msgstr "हालको प्रकार्य छोड्दछ"

#: languages/cpp/debugger/debuggerpart.cpp:275
msgid ""
"<b>Step out</b>"
"<p>Executes the application until the currently executing function is "
"completed. The debugger will then display the line after the original call to "
"that function. If program execution is in the outermost frame (i.e. in main()) "
"then this operation has no effect."
msgstr ""
"<b>निस्कनुहोस्</b>"
"<p>हालको कार्यान्वयन प्रकार्य सम्पन्न नभएसम्म अनुप्रयोग कार्यान्वयन गर्दछ । "
"डिबगरले त्यो प्रकार्यमा मौलिक कलपछि लाइन प्रर्दशन गर्दछ । यदि कार्यक्रम "
"कार्यान्वयन सबभन्दा बाहिरको फ्रेममा छ भने (जस्तै मुख्यमा()) त्यसपछि यो "
"सञ्चालनमा केहि प्रभाव हुँदैन ।"

#: languages/cpp/debugger/dbgtoolbar.cpp:302
#: languages/cpp/debugger/debuggerpart.cpp:283
msgid "Viewers"
msgstr "दृश्यकर्ता"

#: languages/cpp/debugger/debuggerpart.cpp:286
msgid "Debugger viewers"
msgstr "डिबगर दृश्यकर्ता"

#: languages/cpp/debugger/debuggerpart.cpp:287
msgid ""
"<b>Debugger viewers</b>"
"<p>Various information about application being executed. There are 4 views "
"available:"
"<br><b>Memory</b>"
"<br><b>Disassemble</b>"
"<br><b>Registers</b>"
"<br><b>Libraries</b>"
msgstr ""
"<b>डिबगर दृश्यकर्ता</b>"
"<p>अनुप्रयोग कार्यान्वयन हुँदाको विविध सूचना । त्यहा चार दृश्य उपलब्ध छन्::"
"<br><b>स्मृति</b>"
"<br><b>विच्छेदन</b>"
"<br><b>दर्ता</b>"
"<br><b>लाइब्रेरी</b>"

#: languages/cpp/debugger/debuggerpart.cpp:294
msgid "Examine Core File..."
msgstr "कोर फाइल परिक्षण गर्नुहोस्..."

#: languages/cpp/debugger/debuggerpart.cpp:297
msgid "Examine core file"
msgstr "कोर फाइल परिक्षण गर्नुहोस्"

#: languages/cpp/debugger/debuggerpart.cpp:298
msgid ""
"<b>Examine core file</b>"
"<p>This loads a core file, which is typically created after the application has "
"crashed, e.g. with a segmentation fault. The core file contains an image of the "
"program memory at the time it crashed, allowing you to do a post-mortem "
"analysis."
msgstr ""
"<b>कोर फाइल परिक्षण गर्नुहोस्</b>"
"<p>यसले अनुप्रयोग क्र्याश भएपछि सामान्यतया सिर्जना गरिने कोर फाइल लोड गर्दछ । "
"उदाहरणका लागि खण्डिकरण त्रुटिसँग । तपाईँलाई पोष्ट-मोर्टेम विश्लेषण गर्न अनुमति "
"दिदै, यो क्र्याश भएको समयमा कार्यक्रम स्मृतिको छवि कोर फाइलले समाविष्ट गर्दछ ।"

#: languages/cpp/debugger/dbgpsdlg.cpp:59
#: languages/cpp/debugger/debuggerpart.cpp:306
