#: languages/ruby/debugger/debuggerpart.cpp:491
#: languages/ruby/debugger/debuggerpart.cpp:601
msgid ""
"Continue application execution\n"
"\n"
"Continues the execution of your application in the debugger. This only takes "
"effect when the application has been halted by the debugger (i.e. a breakpoint "
"has been activated or the interrupt was pressed)."
msgstr ""
"अनुप्रयोग कार्यान्वयन जारी राख्नुहोस्\n"
"\n"
"तपाईँको अनुप्रयोग डिबगरमा कार्यान्वयन जारी राख्दछ । यसले केबल डिबगरले कार्यक्रम "
"रोके पछि मात्र प्रभाव पार्दछ । (उदाहरणका लागि, विच्छेदन बिन्दु सक्रिय वा "
"अवरूद्ध थिचिएको हुन्थ्यो) ।"

#: languages/cpp/debugger/debuggerpart.cpp:738
#: languages/ruby/debugger/debuggerpart.cpp:568
